# A2/A2.1/A2_05_post_office_and_places.letz
# Source: PDF slide decks "L3 (Part 1)/(Part 2) a21convlotsmanmeli.pdf" (A2.1, Lektioun 3, second half).
# Slide text was baked into the raster; transcribed from rendered pages, then every
# lemma verified against LOD.
# Grammar focus, both from this deck:
#   - kee(n)/keng, the negative indefinite article (m/n kee(n), f/pl keng)
#   - en / se / et, the three pronouns for inanimate objects, chosen by noun gender
#   - movement vs position with countries: `an d'Belsch` (to) vs `an der Belsch` (in)

@lesson A2.05 "Post Office & Places"

# --- Post office ---
@word de Timber = the stamp
@word d'Timberen = the stamps
@word den Bréif = the letter
@word d'Bréiwer = the letters
@word de Pak = the parcel
@word d'Päck = the parcels
@word d'Enveloppe = the envelope
@word d'Bréifboîte = the letter box
@word de Recommandé = the registered letter
@word de Waardesall = the waiting room
@word d'Mëttespaus = the lunch break

# --- Verbs ---
@word schécken = to send
@word verschécken = to send off
@word geheien = to throw
@word weien = to weigh
@word sech umellen = to register
@word plënneren = to move house

# --- Describing ---
@word ze schwéier = too heavy
@word ze grouss = too big
@word ze deier = too expensive

# --- Negation ---
@word kee = no (masculine)
@word keng = no (feminine)

# --- Placement verbs ---
@word sëtzen = to sit
@word setzen = to put in a sitting position
@word stellen = to put in a standing position
@word leeën = to lay down

@sentence
@lu Ech hätt gär en Timber.
@en I would like a stamp.
@distractor-en parcel
@distractor-en envelope
@distractor-lu Pak
@distractor-lu Enveloppe

@sentence
@lu Ech géif gär e Bréif a Schweden schécken.
@en I would like to send a letter to Sweden.
@distractor-en parcel
@distractor-en stamp
@distractor-lu Pak
@distractor-lu Timber

@sentence
@lu Ech wëll e Pak an Däitschland schécken.
@en I want to send a parcel to Germany.
@distractor-en letter
@distractor-en stamp
@distractor-lu Bréif
@distractor-lu Timber

@sentence
@lu Wéi vill weit de Pak?
@en How much does the parcel weigh?
@distractor-en costs
@distractor-en letter
@distractor-lu kascht
@distractor-lu Bréif

@sentence
@lu Ech hoffen, en ass net ze schwéier.
@en I hope it is not too heavy.
@distractor-en expensive
@distractor-en light
@distractor-lu deier
@distractor-lu liicht

@sentence
@lu Et deet mir leed, de Pak ass ze grouss.
@en I am sorry, the parcel is too big.
@distractor-en small
@distractor-en heavy
@distractor-lu kleng
@distractor-lu schwéier

@sentence
@lu Wëllt Dir de Bréif als Recommandé verschécken?
@en Do you want to send the letter as registered mail?
@distractor-en parcel
@distractor-en stamp
@distractor-lu Pak
@distractor-lu Timber

@sentence
@lu Wou ass déi nächst Bréifboîte?
@en Where is the nearest letter box?
@distractor-en stamp
@distractor-en when
@distractor-lu Timber
@distractor-lu Wéini

@sentence
@lu Ech muss dëse Bréif ageheien.
@en I have to post this letter.
@distractor-en parcel
@distractor-en weigh
@distractor-lu Pak
@distractor-lu weien

@sentence
@lu Ech muss op d'Post goen.
@en I have to go to the post office.
@distractor-en bank
@distractor-en letter
@distractor-lu Bank
@distractor-lu Bréif

@sentence
@lu Ech brauch en Timber, fir dëse Bréif ze schécken.
@en I need a stamp in order to send this letter.
@distractor-en parcel
@distractor-en envelope
@distractor-lu Pak
@distractor-lu Enveloppe

@sentence
@lu Ech hätt gär zéng Timberen. Wéi vill kaschte se?
@en I would like ten stamps. How much do they cost?
@distractor-en weigh
@distractor-en five
@distractor-lu weien
@distractor-lu fënnef

@sentence
@lu Gëtt et hei eng Post?
@en Is there a post office here?
@distractor-en bank
@distractor-en stamp
@distractor-lu Bank
@distractor-lu Timber

@sentence
@lu Ech sichen d'Post. Kënnt Dir mir soen, wou se ass?
@en I am looking for the post office. Can you tell me where it is?
@distractor-en bank
@distractor-en stamp
@distractor-lu Bank
@distractor-lu Timber

@sentence
@lu De Keller ass grouss, mä en ass däischter.
@en The cellar is big, but it is dark.
@distractor-en bright
@distractor-en kitchen
@distractor-lu hell
@distractor-lu Kichen

@sentence
