@en I moved house three years ago.
@distractor-en registered
@distractor-en five
@distractor-lu ugemellt
@distractor-lu fënnef

@sentence
@lu Ech muss mech an der Gemeng umellen.
@en I have to register at the commune.
@distractor-en move
@distractor-en post
@distractor-lu plënneren
@distractor-lu Post


# --- Countries and cities: movement versus position ---

@sentence
@lu Ech schécken de Pak an d'Belsch.
@en I am sending the parcel to Belgium.
@distractor-en Sweden
@distractor-en letter
@distractor-lu Schweden
@distractor-lu Bréif

@sentence
@lu De Pak ass an der Belsch.
@en The parcel is in Belgium.
@distractor-en Sweden
@distractor-en stamp
