@distractor-lu wunnen

@sentence
@lu Mir sinn a Schweden.
@en We are in Sweden.
@distractor-en Germany
@distractor-en travelling
@distractor-lu Däitschland
@distractor-lu fueren

@sentence
@lu Ech wëll eng Enveloppe an Amerika schécken.
@en I want to send an envelope to America.
@distractor-en Belgium
@distractor-en parcel
